# unit_effects: unit tests (fx) of FxEffectsAge (01:C060), which no script
# reaches with an effect in use. Screen edges X $00-$100, Y $00-$C0, so
# the margins are X $08-$F8 and Y $08-$B8; R11 = the STOP at $01:80E3.
# Records: inside (kept), X $0004 (left), X $00F8 (right), Y $0004 (top),
# Y $00B8 (bottom), time 1 (counted down to 0, kept), the rest free.
# First with the tied record's word +$4A positive ($0010), then negative,
# then with only the last record in use, so the loop ends on a record in
# use.
